{
  "mn59:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 59 ",
  "mn59:0.2": "Bahuvedanīyasutta ",
  "mn59:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn59:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn59:1.3": "Atha kho pañcakaṅgo thapati yenāyasmā udāyī tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā āyasmantaṁ udāyiṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho pañcakaṅgo thapati āyasmantaṁ udāyiṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn59:1.4": "“kati nu kho, bhante udāyi, vedanā vuttā bhagavatā”ti? ",
  "mn59:1.5": "“Tisso kho, thapati, vedanā vuttā bhagavatā. ",
  "mn59:1.6": "Sukhā vedanā, dukkhā vedanā, adukkhamasukhā vedanā—",
  "mn59:1.7": "imā kho, thapati, tisso vedanā vuttā bhagavatā”ti. ",
  "mn59:1.8": "Evaṁ vutte, pañcakaṅgo thapati āyasmantaṁ udāyiṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn59:1.9": "“na kho, bhante udāyi, tisso vedanā vuttā bhagavatā; ",
  "mn59:1.10": "dve vedanā vuttā bhagavatā—",
  "mn59:1.11": "sukhā vedanā, dukkhā vedanā. ",
  "mn59:1.12": "Yāyaṁ, bhante, adukkhamasukhā vedanā santasmiṁ esā paṇīte sukhe vuttā bhagavatā”ti. ",
  "mn59:2.1": "Dutiyampi kho āyasmā udāyī pañcakaṅgaṁ thapatiṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn59:2.2": "“na kho, gahapati, dve vedanā vuttā bhagavatā; ",
  "mn59:2.3": "tisso vedanā vuttā bhagavatā. ",
  "mn59:2.4": "Sukhā vedanā, dukkhā vedanā, adukkhamasukhā vedanā—",
  "mn59:2.5": "imā kho, thapati, tisso vedanā vuttā bhagavatā”ti. ",
  "mn59:2.6": "Dutiya